{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heterosexual man who avoids women due to deep-seated discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn order to solve the declining birthrate, let\u2019s help men like him overcome their fear of women.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That reckless idea gave birth to the latest android model\u2014Alice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a newly assigned staff member, is given his first mission:<br>to test her functions\u2014specifically, a \u201ccontact test.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how cute she looks, she's just a machine. There's no way this plan will work.<br>\u2014Or so he thought at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as they grow closer, something begins to stir in his heart.<br>\u201cThis can\u2019t be happening. She\u2019s just an android.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man who simply wants to live a quiet, \u201cnormal\u201d life.<br>An innocent, cheerful android girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will their unlikely love story lead...?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686740?t=1750806551","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686740?t=1750806551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686740/5a69f99541396f0a4fcb4545a8e459ae73c925c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750806551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686740/5a69f99541396f0a4fcb4545a8e459ae73c925c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750806551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This title contains romantic themes and mild sexual content.\r\nIt does not include any non-consensual sexual acts, sexual violence, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heterosexual man who avoids women due to deep-seated discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn order to solve the declining birthrate, let\u2019s help men like him overcome their fear of women.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That reckless idea gave birth to the latest android model\u2014Alice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a newly assigned staff member, is given his first mission:<br>to test her functions\u2014specifically, a \u201ccontact test.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how cute she looks, she's just a machine. There's no way this plan will work.<br>\u2014Or so he thought at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as they grow closer, something begins to stir in his heart.<br>\u201cThis can\u2019t be happening. She\u2019s just an android.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man who simply wants to live a quiet, \u201cnormal\u201d life.<br>An innocent, cheerful android girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will their unlikely love story lead...?</p>","developers":["Neutopia"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686740/1ab283930611fbdd818a7fe2ff94579deb7480d5/header.jpg?t=1750806551","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686740/875083/78a752b486a11a4352d38401c28c3eedc30981cc/1750402711/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748573611","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686740/875083/78a752b486a11a4352d38401c28c3eedc30981cc/1750402711/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748573611","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686740/875083/78a752b486a11a4352d38401c28c3eedc30981cc/1750402711/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748573611","id":257129076,"name":"Artificial Affection","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129076/072dd75b31a93a1a24b01